      "content": "That structure makes sense. Could you actually write out a draft for me? I want to make sure the transition from the positive stuff to the punctuality issue doesn't sound too harsh or aggressive, but still gets the point across clearly. Maybe give me a few different versions of that middle section? One that's a bit more direct and maybe one that's a little softer.",
